﴿Indeed they﴾: that is, the followers and those who were followed, all of them together;

﴿on that Day﴾: that is, the Day of Resurrection;

﴿will be sharing in the punishment﴾: just as they were sharing in the misguidance.

Here is the translation of the passage:

﴿Nay, he came with the truth﴾, a refutation of the polytheists;

﴿and confirmed the messengers﴾, like His saying: ﴿confirming what is before it﴾ [al-Baqarah: 97].
